//RS // c109 Phase 5: collections — list/map literals, indexing/slicing, index-assign,
//RS // and `loop x in coll` / `loop (k, v) in map` iteration. The `IndexKind` (List/Map)
//RS // is carried as a total fact from sema and dispatched at lowering (never
//RS // re-inferred). All asserts prove rustc accepts the output (I2) and runs correctly.
//RS 
//RS /// A list literal, indexing, a slice, and single-binding iteration over a
//RS /// list-typed param — all in one covered function pair.
//RS #[test]
//RS fn list_literal_index_slice_and_iteration() {
//RS     if !have_rustc() {
//RS         return;
//RS     }
