//RS /// The E0507 advice names three contracts instead of pretending that an index
//RS /// rewrite preserves an unknown traversal.  Keep one executable witness for
//RS /// each supported repair: a separate result, a fixed original set, and an
//RS /// explicit queue that removes and appends work until empty.
